      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"Erte Deenan\" is the former elven capital.\r\nBeyond the Mysree Forest, in a forest even deeper,\r\nthe now uninhabited \"Deenan Woods\" —",
        "Jp" : "《エルテ・ディナン》はかつてのエルフの都\r\nミスリウの森を抜けたさらに深い森\r\n今は誰も住まない《ディナン深層林》の――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 162050,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "— No, wait. know,\r\nThere was someone studying \r\nelven arts in that forest.",
        "Jp" : "――いや、まてよ\r\nあの森にはエルフの技を研究している者がいたな"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 162051,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yes, the name was Rondejeel. \r\nI once stayed at his \"Bowmaster's Secret Lodge\".",
        "Jp" : "そう、名はたしかロンドジ―ル\r\n俺も一度彼の《秘弓師の住居》で\r\n宿を借りたことがある"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 359687,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He's probably still there. \r\nIf we tell him what's happening, \r\nhe might be able to assist us. \r\nWe can't predict what we'll face.",
        "Jp" : "おそらく彼は今もあの地にいるはずだ\r\n事情を話せば助けになってもらえるかもしれん\r\nどんな状況が待ち受けているか分からないしな――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 162052,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Also, it's a considerable distance. \r\nMake sure to check the map before you leave.",
        "Jp" : "それとかなり遠いぞ？\r\n出発前に地図で確認しておけ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 201595,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
