      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 24,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "However, Lord White Dragon being in such a state \r\nhas caused a decrease in the dragon force \r\ncirculating throughout Lestania.",
        "Jp" : "でも、白竜様があんなことになって\r\nレスタニア全土を巡る竜力が低下した"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 162057,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 25,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "At that time, \r\nthe first thing targeted by Orcs was \"Erte Deenan\"",
        "Jp" : "その時に、真っ先にオークに狙われたのが\r\n《エルテ・ディナン》だ"
